              <h3 class="cs-font_24 mt-4 mb-2">How are payments handled for local and international clients?</h3><p>Local clients can pay in PKR via bank wire to HBL, MCB, or NBP. International clients are invoiced in USD through Wise or Stripe Atlas. Most engagements begin with a fixed-fee discovery sprint, followed by a monthly retainer or fixed-bid project depending on the scope you choose.</p>
